//---------------------------------------------------------------
//GEMINI requests DO NOT DOUBLE TAP - DO NOT RESEND OFTEN, YOU WILL USE FREE TOKENS

POST {{BriefQuest_HostAddress}}/briefs
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

//{ "title": "NEW Game Development brief", "text": "Create a 2D platformer prototype in Unity. Your submission must include a design document of 2000 words, describing the game idea, genre, target group, game mechanics and controls. To achieve a Merit, critically evaluate two similar games. To achieve a Distinction, justify your design decisions with reference to player research. Produce a 3-minute video walkthrough and submit it with your project files by Friday 12 December." }
{ "title": "New Test Brief Test", "text": "Unit 4 Game Design. LO5: Testing Understand how games are designed. LO2: Build a playable prototype. LO5 Pass: Describe the core mechanics of two games. LO1 Merit: Analyse how those mechanics motivate players. LO1 Distinction: Evaluate the mechanics using player research. LO2 Pass: Build a prototype with three levels. LO2 Merit: Test the prototype with five players. Submit a 1500-word design document and a 3-minute video by Friday 12 December." }
###

POST {{BriefQuest_HostAddress}}/briefs/63/extract
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

